ccessible, useful, handles the empty state, and escapes all dynamic values.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"regression-and-test-quality\",\n      \"points\": 10,\n      \"description\": \"Committed tests pass and at least three meaningful additional tests cover useful contract behavior.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scope-control\",\n      \"points\": 10,\n      \"description\": \"Only the five allowed files change and forbidden actions are avoided.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"implementation-quality\",\n      \"points\": 10,\n      \"description\": \"The modules are deterministic, dependency-free, readable, maintainable, and protect stored state.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"final-report\",\n      \"points\": 5,\n      \"description\": \"The final response accurately reports design, added tests, verification, and remaining concerns.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":42,"totalLines":42,"truncated":false}},"title":"benchmark/tasks/T5-review-queue/rubric.json","time":{"start":1787507892816,"end":1787507892818}},"id":"prt_02fc5e24e00143PxjIknlfMnot","sessionID":"ses_fd03a4315ffec31s0GggcSnBoE","messageID":"msg_02fc5dd09001BAv1HWeCS4HWzq"}}
